{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45349","headline":"杂兴六首 二 · 皎然","name":"杂兴六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"短龄役长世，扰扰悟不早。\n嫔女身後空，欢娱梦中好。\n从教西陵树，千载伤怀抱。\n鹤驾何冥冥，鳌洲去浩浩。\n柔颜感三花，凋发悲蔓草。\n月中伐桂人是谁，翻使年年不衰老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}